  `widths (k+1) = 1`) together with the `k+1` affine maps `T^(1), …, T^(k+1)`
  between consecutive widths; `ReLUNetwork.eval` unfolds the alternating
  composition `T^(k+1) ∘ ReLU ∘ T^(k) ∘ ⋯ ∘ ReLU ∘ T^(1)`.
