namespace Star_065

/-!
# Star comparison: `Agent065` vs `Ref`

* `depthBound` is *literally* the same term (`⌈Real.logb 3 ((n : ℝ) - 1)⌉₊ + 1`), so `depth`
  is `rfl`.
